window.SENTS=[{"t0": 0.05, "t1": 5.552, "cap": "This is the plan for the Craigieburn Range traverse, on Saturday the 14th and Sunday the 15th of November."}, {"t0": 6.002, "t1": 11.283, "cap": "Two days along the tops, from Ribbonwood Stream on State Highway 73 to Porters ski area."}, {"t0": 11.733, "t1": 16.476, "cap": "That's about 31 km in total, with a night at the tarns below Mount Cheeseman."}, {"t0": 17.326, "t1": 23.471, "cap": "Day one starts at about 8:30 am at the Ribbonwood Stream bridge, around 660 m above sea level."}, {"t0": 23.921, "t1": 30.973, "cap": "Follow the stream up, then climb Ribbonwood Spur on the north-east side of the range to Baldy Hill, at 1,834 m."}, {"t0": 31.423, "t1": 36.589, "cap": "That's about 4 km and nearly 1,200 m of climbing, the hardest part of the weekend."}, {"t0": 37.039, "t1": 38.482, "cap": "Allow three to four hours."}, {"t0": 39.332, "t1": 49.292, "cap": "From Baldy Hill, the route follows the main ridge south-west over a string of unnamed high points, around 1,800 m, to Hamilton Peak at 1,922 m."}, {"t0": 49.742, "t1": 51.494, "cap": "Hamilton is the planned lunch stop."}, {"t0": 51.944, "t1": 56.722, "cap": "It's about 9 km in, so expect to get there sometime between 1:30 and 3 pm."}, {"t0": 57.572, "t1": 67.292, "cap": "After lunch, the ridge carries on past Nervous Knob, Sunny Peak and Mount Cockayne, slowly gaining height to Mount Cheeseman, at 2,031 m."}, {"t0": 67.742, "t1": 75.331, "cap": "Then it's down about 350 m to the tarns south-west of the summit, at around 1,670 m, for the night."}, {"t0": 75.781, "t1": 79.87, "cap": "Saturday is about 18 km with roughly 2,000 m of climbing."}, {"t0": 80.32, "t1": 83.944, "cap": "Expect eight and a half to eleven hours on the move, plus breaks."}, {"t0": 84.394, "t1": 89.867, "cap": "Sunset is at 8:43 pm, so there is daylight in hand, but not much if the pace is slow."}, {"t0": 90.717, "t1": 93.861, "cap": "Day two starts by 7 am, an hour after sunrise."}, {"t0": 94.311, "t1": 105.914, "cap": "Climb back to the ridge, and head south over Mount Izard at 2,019 m and Mount Cloudesley at 2,107 m, to Mount Enys, the highest point of the range at 2,194 m."}, {"t0": 106.364, "t1": 116.932, "cap": "From Enys, the ridge drops over a few more high points to the top of Porters ski area, then down the ski field to the car park, at about 1,290 m, for the pickup."}, {"t0": 117.382, "t1": 122.779, "cap": "Sunday is about 13.5 km, a thousand metres up and fourteen hundred down."}, {"t0": 123.229, "t1": 127.559, "cap": "Allow six to eight hours, so a finish somewhere between 1 and 3 pm."}, {"t0": 128.409, "t1": 130.308, "cap": "Here is the whole weekend in profile."}, {"t0": 130.758, "t1": 133.492, "cap": "Saturday is a big climb and then a long ridge."}, {"t0": 133.942, "t1": 138.383, "cap": "Sunday sits higher, mostly between 1,900 and 2,200 m."}, {"t0": 138.833, "t1": 144.435, "cap": "These distances come from an 8 m terrain model, so treat them as estimates, give or take ten percent."}, {"t0": 145.285, "t1": 145.986, "cap": "Now the weather."}, {"t0": 146.436, "t1": 151.317, "cap": "MetService's mountain forecast, issued on Friday afternoon, looks good for Saturday."}, {"t0": 151.767, "t1": 154.549, "cap": "Fine, with high cloud increasing in the afternoon."}, {"t0": 154.999, "t1": 160.806, "cap": "Winds at 2,000 m are westerly at about 30 km/h, rising to 50 in the evening."}, {"t0": 161.256, "t1": 166.868, "cap": "The freezing level is well above the tops, and the ski field forecasts give about 1 to 11 degrees."}, {"t0": 167.718, "t1": 168.964, "cap": "Sunday is the problem."}, {"t0": 169.414, "t1": 180.68, "cap": "The forecast is for north-west gales of 70 km/h at 2,000 m, rising to severe gales of about 100 km/h before dawn, with showers developing in the afternoon."}, {"t0": 181.13, "t1": 185.082, "cap": "Further west, on the Main Divide, it's showers turning to heavy rain."}, {"t0": 185.532, "t1": 192.129, "cap": "Sunday's route is exposed ridge, most of it above 1,900 m, and Mount Enys is the highest point."}, {"t0": 192.579, "t1": 197.645, "cap": "In a severe gale, walking can become impossible, and the risk of being blown over is high."}, {"t0": 198.095, "t1": 201.405, "cap": "The camp at the tarns will also be in the rising nor'wester overnight."}, {"t0": 202.255, "t1": 204.701, "cap": "So here are some options to talk through before you go."}, {"t0": 205.151, "t1": 209.448, "cap": "First, check the updated forecast on Saturday morning, because it may change."}, {"t0": 209.898, "t1": 213.617, "cap": "Second, keep Saturday as planned but have an exit ready for Sunday."}, {"t0": 214.067, "t1": 222.634, "cap": "Mount Cheeseman ski field is about 4 km from the tarns, and its access road leads down to State Highway 73, so the pickup would need to move there."}, {"t0": 223.084, "t1": 227.172, "cap": "Third, shorten the trip to fit the good day, or move it to a calmer weekend."}, {"t0": 228.022, "t1": 228.645, "cap": "In summary."}, {"t0": 229.095, "t1": 232.556, "cap": "Saturday is 18 km and a big climb in good weather."}, {"t0": 233.006, "t1": 239.332, "cap": "Sunday is 13.5 km along the highest part of the range, with a severe gale currently forecast."}, {"t0": 239.782, "t1": 247.169, "cap": "Leave your intentions with someone, take a personal locator beacon, check MetService again before you leave, and enjoy the hills."}];
